            <ArticleTitle>[Topical aspects of contemporary forms of occupational bronchial asthma].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>19-24</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Occupational bronchial asthma is a variable, heterogenious disease. Occupational factors are triggers and inductors of the pathologic process, cause formation of various clinical phenotypes of asthma, on background of genetic predisposition, changed metabolic adaptation, energetic systems, neuro-humoral regulation, immune state.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
